<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 16.5pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; WORD-BREAK: break-all; mso-pagination: widow-orphan" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Simsun; mso-hansi-font-family: Simsun; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">　　</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Simsun','serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt" lang=EN-US>■</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Simsun; mso-hansi-font-family: Simsun; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">通讯员</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Simsun','serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt" lang=EN-US> </SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Simsun; mso-hansi-font-family: Simsun; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">王泽权</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Simsun','serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 18.75pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; WORD-BREAK: break-all; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Simsun; mso-hansi-font-family: Simsun; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">　　本报讯</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Simsun','serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt" lang=EN-US> 3</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Simsun; mso-hansi-font-family: Simsun; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">月</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Simsun','serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt" lang=EN-US>7</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Simsun; mso-hansi-font-family: Simsun; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">日下午，市委教育工委书记、市教育局局长贺晓敏带领开学工作专项检查组和立项监督检查</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Simsun','serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt" lang=EN-US>“</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Simsun; mso-hansi-font-family: Simsun; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">回头看</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Simsun','serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt" lang=EN-US>”</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Simsun; mso-hansi-font-family: Simsun; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">工作组的同志，专项检查绍兴一中工作。　　</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Simsun','serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 18.75pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; WORD-BREAK: break-all; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Simsun; mso-hansi-font-family: Simsun; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">　　当看到绍兴一中校园环境整洁、教学秩序井然、师生精神饱满，各项工作开展有条不紊时，贺晓敏对此给予充分肯定，并对新学期工作提出希望和要求。希望在新的学年里，绍兴一中要夯实基础，整改问题，通过切切实实、认认真真地整改，做实做好各项基础性工作。要提升质量，超常规发展，借助市委、市政府对绍兴一中高位发展政策，招得优秀学生，引进优质师资，实现学校的超常规发展。要带好队伍，注重</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Simsun','serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt" lang=EN-US>“</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Simsun; mso-hansi-font-family: Simsun; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">两手抓</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Simsun','serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt" lang=EN-US>”</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Simsun; mso-hansi-font-family: Simsun; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">，校领导要带头树形象，优化学校的干部队伍和教师队伍建设，打造充满激情、富有战斗力的中层干部队伍、班主任队伍、名优教师队伍和青年教师队伍。要抓好党建工作、业务工作</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Simsun','serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt" lang=EN-US>“</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Simsun; mso-hansi-font-family: Simsun; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">双带头</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Simsun','serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt" lang=EN-US>”</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Simsun; mso-hansi-font-family: Simsun; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">，提高政治站位，提升教学技艺，推进师德师风建设。学校要抓住新的历史机遇，提高办学品位，打造教育特色，提升竞争力，不断满足绍兴人民对优质高中教育的需求。　　</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Simsun','serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 18.75pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; WORD-BREAK: break-all; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Simsun; mso-hansi-font-family: Simsun; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">　　本次开学工作专项检查是市委教育工委贯彻全市抓落实工作会议精神，进一步提升全市教育工作水平的重要举措。专项检查自</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Simsun','serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt" lang=EN-US>3</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Simsun; mso-hansi-font-family: Simsun; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">月</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Simsun','serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt" lang=EN-US>6</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Simsun; mso-hansi-font-family: Simsun; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">日开始到</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Simsun','serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt" lang=EN-US>13</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Simsun; mso-hansi-font-family: Simsun; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">日结束，由市委教育工委班子成员分头带队赴各区、县（市）、市直学校、在绍高校和民办学校实地督导检查。检查组听取了各区、县（市）教育局和学校负责人对春季开学情况的汇报，深入学校门卫室、教室、功能室、食堂、运动场等地，踏看学校的开学条件保障、安全管理、控烟、食品与饮水安全以及校园周边环境综合治理等情况。立项监督检查</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Simsun','serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt" lang=EN-US>“</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Simsun; mso-hansi-font-family: Simsun; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">回头看</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Simsun','serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt" lang=EN-US>”</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Simsun; mso-hansi-font-family: Simsun; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">工作组聚焦市直学校党组织建设、大额资金使用、低收入学生资助、维修改造和设施设备改造项目实施、职业教育内涵提升工程实施和食品安全情况等六个方面工作重点，进行严肃、细致检查，掌握整改落实情况。　　</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Simsun','serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 18.75pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; WORD-BREAK: break-all; mso-pagination: widow-orphan; mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Simsun; mso-hansi-font-family: Simsun; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt">　　教育工作涉及千家万户，关乎群众切身利益。专项检查组要求各地各学校从讲政治、讲大局、讲党性的高度认识和落实国家、省、市有关春季开学工作督查的重要指示精神和工作部署，增强责任意识，落实领导责任、岗位责任和协同责任，把学校安全责任落到实处。强调要求增强服务意识，狠抓国家教育惠民政策落实，解决好春季开学工作中存在的困难和问题；增强风险意识，完善校园安全风险管控机制，深入开展安全隐患排查整治，积极稳妥做好安全事故处置，切实维护学校安全稳定。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 'Simsun','serif'; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; mso-bidi-font-family: 宋体; mso-font-kerning: 0pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></FONT></P></TD></TR></TBODY></TABLE>
<P style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p><FONT size=3 face=Calibri> </FONT></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p><FONT size=3 face=Calibri> </FONT></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="TEXT-INDENT: 173.25pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 16.5" class=MsoNormal><FONT size=3><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">（摘自绍兴教育导刊</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">  </SPAN>2018</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">年</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>3</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">月</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><FONT face=Calibri>14</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">日</SPAN><SPAN lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes"><FONT face=Calibri>  </FONT></SPAN></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-fareast; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin">周三）</SPAN></FONT><SPAN lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
    
